      "description": "## Zotero Highlights Sync 0.1.0\n\nFirst public release.\n\n### Features\n\n- Create linked book and annotations notes from Zotero.\n- Synchronize PDF highlights, comments, colors, pages, and deep links.\n- Restore paragraph and list structure from PDF files.\n- Create and update atomic annotation notes.\n- Preserve manually renamed notes and user-authored content.\n- Use configurable Obsidian templates.",
